e year 1858, by E.W. Rucker in Clerks Office in the District Court og the U.S. for the Western District of Tennessee.\" Pen-and-ink and watercolors pasted together from 4 sheets, taped and sectioned in 2 and mounted on cloth backing. In inked script on verso: Memphis, Tenn. &c &c, 1858 E.W. Rucker. Copy imperfect: Brittle, soiled, torn, missing small edge sections, taped on recto, discoloration and spotting, taped along fold lines on verso. Includes indexed list of references and decorated border. Available also through the Library of Congress Web site as a raster image."], "digitized": true, "extract_timestamp": "2026-04-29T15:39:20.258Z", "group": ["gmd.mar", "catalog-split-04", "catalog", "general-maps", "main-catalog-split-04"], "hassegments": false, "id": "http://www.loc.gov/item/2012586237/", "image_url": ["https://tile.loc.gov/storage-services/service/gmd/gmd396/g3964/g3964m/la002025.gif", "https://tile.loc.gov/storage-services/service/gmd/gmd396/g3964/g3964m/la002025.gif#h=150&w=232", "https://tile.loc.gov/image-services/iiif/service:gmd:gmd396:g3964:g3964m:la002025/full/pct:12.5/0/default.jpg#h=1898&w=2933", "https://tile.loc.gov/image-services/iiif/service:gmd:gmd396:g3964:g3964m:la002025/full/pct:25/0/default.jpg#h=3797&w=5867"], "index": 1, "language": ["english"], "location": ["tennessee", "united states", "memphis"], "mime_type": ["image/gif", "image/tiff", "image/jpeg", "image/jp2"], "number": ["sheet", "2025-06-07t05:00:18.300000", "2012586237", "2012-04-09t09:42:59"], "online_format": ["image"], "original_format": ["map"], "partof": ["county landownership maps", "cultural landscapes", "geography and map division", "catalog"], "score": 21.451288, "shelf_id": "G3964.M5G46 1858 .R8", "site": ["catalog"], "subject": ["real property", "tennessee", "cadastral maps", "united states", "maps", "memphis (tenn.)", "memphis", "landowners"], "timestamp": "2026-04-29T16:03:59.785Z", "title": "Map of the city of Memphis : including Fort Pickering and Hopefield, Ar